@Sofia Marchetti: I haven't emailed Corinne yet, and nothing is drafted.

Sending mail to an address outside pemberline.com, even as a draft, needs Ruth Calloway's approval. Because the email states a discount, June Osei-Lark (or Anselm Grieve) also has to approve it. I've asked Ruth and June by DM and recorded both requests.

I checked #coastal-team. The only Saltmarsh discount figure since the November 2025 correction is 10%, so it matches what you wrote. Once Ruth and June both say yes, I'll draft the email to Corinne for you to review and send.
